{"4411600":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"挂机破坏神 IdleDiablo","steam_appid":4411600,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4972260,4845720],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an idle loot game where everything can be farmed. Your time invested will always bring tangible rewards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no absolute best gear — only unique builds tailored to your playstyle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment Acquisition<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment, Skills and Amulet are primarily obtained randomly by defeating monsters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also forge and combine items via in-game systems to craft legendary artifacts, empowering you to take on stronger foes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapters &amp; Difficulties<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 5 main chapters, each containing multiple stages.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 23 difficulty modes in total: Normal, Nightmare, Hell, and Torment 1 to 20. Higher difficulties grant rarer loot.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special dungeons will be unlocked once you clear Hell difficulty. Challenge formidable enemies within to acquire superior items.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endgame Content<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear Torment 10 to unlock <strong>Rift Dungeons<\/strong>. Spend Rift Coins dropped here to obtain premium crafting materials and forge top-tier equipment.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an idle loot game where everything can be farmed. Your time invested will always bring tangible rewards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no absolute best gear — only unique builds tailored to your playstyle.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment Acquisition<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment, Skills and Amulet are primarily obtained randomly by defeating monsters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also forge and combine items via in-game systems to craft legendary artifacts, empowering you to take on stronger foes.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapters &amp; Difficulties<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 5 main chapters, each containing multiple stages.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 23 difficulty modes in total: Normal, Nightmare, Hell, and Torment 1 to 20. Higher difficulties grant rarer loot.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special dungeons will be unlocked once you clear Hell difficulty. Challenge formidable enemies within to acquire superior items.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endgame Content<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear Torment 10 to unlock <strong>Rift Dungeons<\/strong>. Spend Rift Coins dropped here to obtain premium crafting materials and forge top-tier equipment.<\/p>","short_description":"《IdleDiablo》is a Diablo-inspired idle loot game. Earn resources while idle, build your equipment &amp; skills, and conquer all foes!","supported_languages":"영어, 중국어 간체, 프랑스어, 독일어, 러시아어, 일본어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4411600\/1a56fe236167083e74c016f79aa3b9c86af2ea77\/header.jpg?t=1784689797","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4411600\/de5f4d30764a6255168411e7486de08d4dc301f5\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784689797","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4411600\/de5f4d30764a6255168411e7486de08d4dc301f5\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784689797","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>운영 체제 *:<\/strong> Windows 7\/8\/10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-750, 2.67 GHz \/ AMD A12-9800<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti \/ AMD Radeon HD 7770<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/s